Third-Party Data Notice:
This repository ingests and indexes publicly accessible stream metadata and public domain feeds. Channel metadata, categories, and public stream pointers may originate from open community indexing projects, including the public datasets curated by iptv-org (https://github.com/iptv-org/iptv and https://github.com/iptv-org/api), released under the Unlicense or MIT licenses.

Livora TV does not host, broadcast, archive, or retransmit video content. All streams are served directly by their respective public broadcast origin servers.
